---
title: "confirm_request_mut (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_action: assert policy.rules.contains(request.name)
    q_check_action --> q_abort_action: action not in rules
    q_abort_action --> [*]: abort EUnknownAction
    q_check_action --> q_check_spent: action in rules
    q_check_spent --> q_abort_spent: spent_balance.is_none()
    q_abort_spent --> [*]: abort EUseImmutableConfirm
    q_check_spent --> q_extract: spent_balance.is_some()
    q_extract --> q_join: policy.spent_balance.join(request.spent_balance.extract())
    q_join --> q_delegate: confirm_request(policy, request, ctx)
    q_delegate --> [*]: return (name, amount, sender, recipient)

    note right of q_extract
        INV-001: spent_balance is extracted from request and joined to policy
        INV-002: policy.spent_balance accumulates all spent funds
        INV-003: only TreasuryCap owner can flush spent_balance via flush()
    end note
